Package: sqc
Title: Companion Tools for a Statistical Quality Control Course
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tyler", "Grimes", email = "tyler.grimes.unf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Control chart constants (d2, d3, c4, A2, D3, D4, and others),
    Shewhart X-bar and R charts drawn with ggplot2, and the example datasets
    used in the lecture slides and notes.
